          </div>
          <a href="#workflow" class="nav__link">How it works</a>
          <a href="#cases" class="nav__link">Customers</a>
          <a href="#pricing" class="nav__link">Pricing</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="nav__right">
          <a href={site.loginUrl} class="nav__login">Log in</a>
          <a href="#demo" class="btn btn--sm">Book a demo</a>
          <button type="button" class="burger" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mnav" data-burger>
            <span></span><span></span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mnav" id="mnav" hidden data-mnav>
        <a href="#platform">Platform</a>
        <a href="#workflow">How it works</a>
        <a href="#cases">Customers</a>
        <a href="#audits">Audits</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
        <a href={site.loginUrl}>Log in</a>
        <a href="#demo" class="btn">Book a demo</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="wrap">
          <h1 class="jumbo rv" data-mode-title>Keep every claim you’ve earned</h1>
          <p class="lead hero__sub rv" style="--d:.06s" data-mode-sub>
            Catch invoice shortages early, stop recoupments and answer every PBM audit with confidence—with continuous
            NDC reconciliation and a dedicated audit specialist.
